      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "FE35EED32F281E40",
      "text": "欢迎来到锦汇道馆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "FE35F1D32F282359",
      "text": "我要登记一下\\n挑战者的名字……\\r\\n你是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，没错吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "FE35F0D32F2821A6",
      "text": "想和本道馆的\\n馆主青木对战，\\r\\n需要先通过道馆测验才行。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "FE35F3D32F2826BF",
      "text": "锦汇道馆的\\n道馆测验是……\\r\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]点秘密菜单的菜[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "FE35F2D32F28250C",
      "text": "过关条件是在锦汇镇中\\n很受欢迎的[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]宝食堂[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\r\\n点秘密菜单的菜。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "FE35F5D32F282A25",
      "text": "现在这个镇子里\\n除你之外还有３位\\r\\n道馆测验的挑战者。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "FE35F4D32F282872",
      "text": "每位挑战者都知道一部分\\n秘密菜单的提示，但内容都不一样。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_08",
      "hash64": "FE35F7D32F282D8B",
      "text": "请你们几位挑战者互相对战，\\n输的一方要把自己知道的提示\\r\\n告诉赢的一方。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_09",
      "hash64": "FE35F6D32F282BD8",
      "text": "然后根据收集到的提示，\\n找宝食堂的店员\\r\\n点秘密菜单的菜吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_10",
      "hash64": "FE3289D32F253CCA",
      "text": "能成功点菜的挑战者就能\\n通过道馆测验，仅限一人。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_11",
      "hash64": "FE328AD32F253E7D",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你的提示是[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]常客的吃法[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_normal_010_receptionist_12",
      "hash64": "FE3287D32F253964",
      "text": "去向宝食堂的常客\\n打听一下或许是个好主意哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
